{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55320","headline":"题华山 · 陈抟","name":"题华山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"半夜天香入岩谷，西风吹落岭头莲。\n空爱掌痕侵碧汉，无人曾叹巨灵仙。\n（《增修诗话总龟》卷十六、卷四十六引《翰府名谈》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈抟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55320.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55320","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}